                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} f(x) \neq f(y)
          .un_thm
            %h6#theorem_stoneweierstrass Theorem (Stone–Weierstrass)
            %p
              A subalgebra inclusion
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi A
                    %mo ⊆
                    %mi C
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi X
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A \subseteq C(X)
              is dense if and only if it separates points. Equivalently, a Banach subalgebra inclusion
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi A
                    %mo ⊆
                    %mi C
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi X
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A \subseteq C(X)
              is the identity if and only if it separates points.
          %h2#outline_of_proof Outline of proof
          %ul
            %li
